exceeded`（terminal_state='unknown'）+ paused reason `stalled`；返回 `@{ now; probed=@(node ids) }`。④`Submit-RelayResultFile([hashtable]$Run,[string]$NodeId,[string]$Path)`：node 不存在→`@{ok=$false; reason='unknown-node'}`（不追加事件）；attempt_id=0→事件 `result_rejected` reason `no-attempt`；`Current=@{node_id;attempt_id;launch_id;session_id;final_committed}`；`$auth=Read-RelayAuthority`、`$ap=Read-RelayActivePlan`；先 try 解析 `$Path`（失败→事件 `result_rejected` reason `unparseable-result`、返回）；`$v=Get-RelayResultVerdict $obj $auth $ap $Current`；按 K-2 映射：非 accept→事件 `result_stale`/`result_rejected`（identity=对象里 7 字段子集，reason=$v.reason）→返回 `@{ok=$false; verdict; reason}` **且不改 state**；accept→`Test-RelayResultTransition 当前 result_status $obj.result_status`：reason='reserved-target-form'（quota）→事件 `result_rejected` reason `reserved-target-form` + 应用 K-7（result=interrupted_unknown 走 `Test-RelayResultTransition` 判、paused reason `quota-fallback`）返回；其它不 ok→事件 `result_rejected` reason=<矩阵 reason> 返回；ok→`Write-RelayJsonCreateNew attempts/<node>/<attempt>/result.json`（存在→事件 `result_rejected` reason `final-immutable` 返回）；state：final_committed=$true、result_status、next_action、last_progress_at=now、清除所有节点 frozen_by 中的本 node；按状态：succeeded→scheduling='succeeded'（**task_state 保持 'active'**）；dependency_blocked→scheduling='blocked'、`replan_required=$true`、Save、事件 `result_accepted`、**然后** `& adapter.stop session_id`（先 ack 后回收；stop 结果 ok=false 只记 findings 不改状态）；interrupted_unknown→paused reason `worker-reported-interruption`；Save；事件 `result_accepted`（succeeded/interrupted 路径在这里追加；blocked 路径已追加）；返回 `@{ok=$true; result_status}`。⑤`Submit-RelayCheckpointFile([hashtable]$Run,[string]$NodeId,[string]$Path)`：同样解析失败→`checkpoint_rejected` reason `unparseable-checkpoint`；`Get-RelayCheckpointVerdict`→非 accept→事件 `checkpoint_rejected` reason=$v.reason 返回不改 state；accept：status 同当前→进度更新（K-5）；不同→`Test-RelayResultTransition` 不 ok→`checkpoint_rejected` reason=<矩阵 reason>；ok→result_status=status；若新状态 `decision_required`→`Get-RelayNo